              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Using the report",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "16px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#235F96"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Story: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Start on Home, then follow chapters 1–6 with the Next button; each page opens with its question and an automatic key takeaway that updates with the slicers.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Period: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "MTD (the default) shows this month to date, YTD this year to date, each on top of the date range when one is set. The monthly trend charts always show every month of the date range.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Slicers: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Period, Date range (type or pick the start and end dates), Branch, Care setting, Specialty and Question group are synced: a selection carries to every page that has the same slicer. Page 4 has no Branch slicer so it always compares all branches.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Drill down: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "on page 3, right-click a question-group bar > Drill down to see its questions.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Drill through: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "on page 5, right-click a doctor or a specialty > Drill through to open its own 'What Drives the Score' page; use ‹ Back to return.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Buttons: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "a normal click on the Report Server; Ctrl + click while editing in Power BI Desktop.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
                      "fontSize": "13px",
                      "color": "#3C4D60"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Clicking a chart: ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
