                      "fontWeight": "bold",
                      "color": "#0A1E32"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Press Ganey patient surveys in the HNH_Analytics model (Patient Experience perspective), live connection: figures are as of the model's last refresh. Every measure is defined in the model and documented there (hover a field in Power BI Desktop).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Zain, Segoe UI",
